# Concurrent-session coordination state (AIF-050 coordination component).
#
# Transient — NOT committed (per-session presence + advisory locks; they mean nothing
# across machines/time and would just churn the tree):
active_sessions/
locks/
quips/
#
# Durable — the AIF-number claim ledger IS tracked and committed. Each aif/AIF-NNN.claim
# is the authoritative record of who allocated that lane number and when. The atomic
# O_EXCL create coordinates concurrent LOCAL sessions in real time; committing the ledger
# makes the allocation durable and shareable across sessions.
!aif/
!aif/*.claim
